{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-opus-4-6","id":"msg_01QJt42FfDRBtP7ZfFH3yjmb","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"```yaml\ntier: worst\nnarrative_guidance: \"放弃 'universal K*=2' 作为 headline。Reframe 为 'K* as a model-family-dependent characterization quantity'：K*∈{1,2,3} 取决于 (architecture, scale, representation) 三元组，但 K*≤3 是 DPI-bounded universal upper limit。新 headline result 变为 'We provide the first systematic measurement of K* and reveal it is bounded, small (≤3), and predictable from model family properties'。\"\n\nimagined_experiments:\n  - name: \"LLaMA-3.1-8B cross-family depth chain\"\n    plan_id: \"exp-018\"\n    description: \"LLaMA-3.1-8B, continuation mode, nucleus p=0.95 T=1.0, C4 5K docs, depth 0-5, scorer=Qwen2.5-1.5B\"\n    expected_results:\n      k_star: 1\n      pairwise_auc:\n        0v1: 0.9812\n        1v2: 0.5783\n        2v3: 0.5341\n        3v4: 0.5128\n        4v5: 0.5067\n      pairwise_auc_std:\n        0v1: 0.0028\n        1v2: 0.0095\n        2v3: 0.0072\n        3v4: 0.0088\n        4v5: 0.0063\n      bootstrap_ci:\n        0v1: {auc: 0.9812, ci_lower: 0.9779, ci_upper: 0.9843, perm_p: 0.0001}\n        1v2: {auc: 0.5783, ci_lower: 0.5688, ci_upper: 0.5879, perm_p: 0.0001}\n        2v3: {auc: 0.5341, ci_lower: 0.5243, ci_upper: 0.5438, perm_p: 0.0003}\n        3v4: {auc: 0.5128, ci_lower: 0.5024, ci_upper: 0.5231, perm_p: 0.0312}\n        4v5: {auc: 0.5067, ci_lower: 0.4963, ci_upper: 0.5172, perm_p: 0.1423}\n      pairwise_jsd:\n        0v1: 0.1583\n        1v2: 0.0062\n        2v3: 0.0034\n        3v4: 0.0025\n        4v5: 0.0019\n      ordinal_mae: 1.31\n      ordinal_accuracy: 0.3241\n      top_features: [surp_std, freq_entropy, surp_d1_mean, surp_skew, ttr]\n    result_rationale: \"LLaMA-3.1-8B 的 tokenizer（BPE 128K vocab）与 Qwen-1.5B scorer 的 tokenizer 不匹配程度远大于 Qwen-7B→Qwen-1.5B（同族）。Cross-family scoring 引入 tokenization mismatch：LLaMA 生成文本的 token boundary 与 Qwen scorer 的 surprisal 计算不对齐，导致 surprisal-based features 的 depth-discriminative signal 被系统性削弱。8B 规模模型的 continuation 质量更高（更接近 human text），depth-1 文本本身退化更小，使得 1v2 区分更难。1v2 AUC=0.578 < θ=0.60，CI upper=0.5879 < 0.60，判定 K*=1。这不是说 LLaMA 没有 depth signal，而是 cross-family scorer 无法捕获它——K* 依赖于 (generator, scorer) pair。\"\n    tables:\n      - caption: \"LLaMA-8B pairwise AUC with bootstrap CI (scorer=Qwen-1.5B)\"\n        columns: [depth_pair, auc, ci_lower, ci_upper, perm_p, \"passes_θ=0.60\"]\n        rows:\n          - [0v1, 0.9812, 0.9779, 0.9843, 0.0001, \"✅\"]\n          - [1v2, 0.5783, 0.5688, 0.5879, 0.0001, \"❌ (CI upper < 0.60)\"]\n          - [2v3, 0.5341, 0.5243, 0.5438, 0.0003, \"❌\"]\n          - [3v4, 0.5128, 0.5024, 0.5231, 0.0312, \"❌\"]\n          - [4v5, 0.5067, 0.4963, 0.5172, 0.1423, \"❌\"]\n    figures_description:\n      - \"AUC decay curve: steep drop from 0v1 (0.98) to 1v2 (0.578), then near-chance plateau from 2v3 onward. Compared to Qwen-7B (same scale, same scorer) which shows 1v2=0.618, LLaMA drops ~4pp — the cross-family gap.\"\n    analysis: \"K*=1 结论意味着 Qwen-1.5B scorer 在 LLaMA-8B 生成链上仅能区分 human vs gen-1，无法区分 gen-1 vs gen-2。这与 exp-004（Qwen-7B, 同族 scorer, K*=2）形成对比，暴露 K* 的 scorer-dependence。如果用 LLaMA 自身做 scorer 可能恢复 K*=2，但实验设计使用 fixed scorer 以测试 universality——结果否定了 scorer-independent universality。\"\n\n  - name: \"Mistral-7B cross-family depth chain\"\n    plan_id: \"exp-019\"\n    description: \"Mistral-7B-v0.3, continuation mode, nucleus p=0.95 T=1.0, C4 5K docs, depth 0-5, scorer=Qwen2.5-1.5B\"\n    expected_results:\n      k_star: 1\n      pairwise_auc:\n        0v1: 0.9756\n        1v2: 0.5692\n        2v3: 0.5287\n        3v4: 0.5095\n        4v5: 0.5042\n      pairwise_auc_std:\n        0v1: 0.0031\n        1v2: 0.0103\n        2v3: 0.0068\n        3v4: 0.0091\n        4v5: 0.0074\n      bootstrap_ci:\n        0v1: {auc: 0.9756, ci_lower: 0.9718, ci_upper: 0.9791, perm_p: 0.0001}\n        1v2: {auc: 0.5692, ci_lower: 0.5591, ci_upper: 0.5794, perm_p: 0.0001}\n        2v3: {auc: 0.5287, ci_lower: 0.5189, ci_upper: 0.5384, perm_p: 0.0008}\n        3v4: {auc: 0.5095, ci_lower: 0.4988, ci_upper: 0.5198, perm_p: 0.0891}\n        4v5: {auc: 0.5042, ci_lower: 0.4937, ci_upper: 0.5148, perm_p: 0.2341}\n      pairwise_jsd:\n        0v1: 0.1421\n        1v2: 0.0054\n        2v3: 0.0029\n        3v4: 0.0021\n        4v5: 0.0016\n      ordinal_mae: 1.35\n      ordinal_accuracy: 0.3118\n      top_features: [freq_entropy, surp_std, surp_d1_skew, surp_mean, hapax_ratio]\n    result_rationale: \"Mistral-7B 使用 sliding window attention (SWA, window=4096)，其 continuation 生成的文本在局部 coherence 上与 human text 更相似（SWA 限制了长距离 dependency 退化的速度），同时 Mistral 的 32K vocab BPE tokenizer 与 Qwen 的 151K vocab tokenizer 差异极大。这双重因素使 cross-family scorer 信号更弱：(1) Mistral 生成质量退化本身更缓慢（SWA 架构特性），(2) tokenizer mismatch 进一步削弱 surprisal features 的 discriminative power。1v2 AUC=0.569, CI upper=0.579 < 0.60，K*=1。Mistral 比 LLaMA 还低 ~1pp，因为 SWA 使得 depth-1 和 depth-2 文本在 surface statistics 上更相似。\"\n    tables:\n      - caption: \"Mistral-7B pairwise AUC with bootstrap CI (scorer=Qwen-1.5B)\"\n        columns: [depth_pair, auc, ci_lower, ci_upper, perm_p, \"passes_θ=0.60\"]\n        rows:\n          - [0v1, 0.9756, 0.9718, 0.9791, 0.0001, \"✅\"]\n          - [1v2, 0.5692, 0.5591, 0.5794, 0.0001, \"❌ (CI upper < 0.60)\"]\n          - [2v3, 0.5287, 0.5189, 0.5384, 0.0008, \"❌\"]\n          - [3v4, 0.5095, 0.4988, 0.5198, 0.0891, \"❌\"]\n          - [4v5, 0.5042, 0.4937, 0.5148, 0.2341, \"❌\"]\n    figures_description:\n      - \"AUC decay curve 与 LLaMA-8B 类似但更低。0v1 处 AUC 也略低（0.976 vs LLaMA 0.981），说明 Mistral 生成的 gen-0→gen-1 信号在 Qwen scorer 下也被轻微压制。3v4 和 4v5 已无显著性（p>0.05）。\"\n    analysis: \"Mistral K*=1 确认了 worst tier 核心假设。两个 7B+ cross-family 模型均 K*=1，与已有的 ≤1.5B 自评 K*=2 形成系统性分裂。但注意：0v1 AUC 仍 >0.97，binary detection 能力未受影响——K*=1 只意味着 'depth estimation beyond binary 在 cross-family scoring 下失败'，不影响实用的 binary contamination detection。这恰好支持 reframing：K* 取决于 measurement setup，但 K*≤3 作为上界是 robust 的。\"\n\n  - name: \"Pythia-1.4B decoding strategy ablation\"\n    plan_id: \"exp-020\"\n    description: \"Pythia-1.4B, greedy / nucleus p=0.9 / T=0.7 / T=1.2, C4 5K docs, depth 0-5\"\n    expected_results:\n      config1_greedy:\n        k_star: 2\n        pairwise_auc: {0v1: 0.9891, 1v2: 0.6412, 2v3: 0.5423, 3v4: 0.5134, 4v5: 0.5078}\n        bootstrap_ci:\n          1v2: {auc: 0.6412, ci_lower: 0.6318, ci_upper: 0.6507, perm_p: 0.0001}\n          2v3: {auc: 0.5423, ci_lower: 0.5324, ci_upper: 0.5521, perm_p: 0.0001}\n      config2_nuc09:\n        k_star: 2\n        pairwise_auc: {0v1: 0.9918, 1v2: 0.6487, 2v3: 0.5478, 3v4: 0.5156, 4v5: 0.5091}\n        bootstrap_ci:\n          1v2: {auc: 0.6487, ci_lower: 0.6392, ci_upper: 0.6583, perm_p: 0.0001}\n          2v3: {auc: 0.5478, ci_lower: 0.5379, ci_upper: 0.5576, perm_p: 0.0001}\n      config3_t07:\n        k_star: 1\n        pairwise_auc: {0v1: 0.9873, 1v2: 0.5948, 2v3: 0.5389, 3v4: 0.5112, 4v5: 0.5054}\n        bootstrap_ci:\n          1v2: {auc: 0.5948, ci_lower: 0.5851, ci_upper: 0.6042, perm_p: 0.0001}\n          2v3: {auc: 0.5389, ci_lower: 0.5291, ci_upper: 0.5488, perm_p: 0.0001}\n      config4_t12:\n        k_star: 1\n        pairwise_auc: {0v1: 0.9953, 1v2: 0.5912, 2v3: 0.5512, 3v4: 0.5198, 4v5: 0.5123}\n        bootstrap_ci:\n          1v2: {auc: 0.5912, ci_lower: 0.5813, ci_upper: 0.6008, perm_p: 0.0001}\n          2v3: {auc: 0.5512, ci_lower: 0.5412, ci_upper: 0.5611, perm_p: 0.0001}\n      overall_kstar2_count: \"2/4\"\n    result_rationale: \"Worst tier 假设 Pythia decoding 2/4 K*=2（模型族 × 解码交互效应）。Pythia-1.4B 自评在 exp-001（nucleus p=0.95 T=1.0）给出 K*=2，AUC 1v2=0.654。但不同 decoding 下：(1) Greedy 和 nucleus p=0.9 保持 K*=2，因为它们的 stochasticity 与 exp-001 原始条件相近（greedy 减少了 noise 但也减少了 diversity → depth signal 在 surprisal features 上仍可捕获；nucleus 0.9 与 0.95 差异小）；(2) T=0.7 使得生成文本 diversity 降低，gen-1 和 gen-2 的 surface statistics 更相似（低温度 → 更 deterministic → token distribution 变窄 → surprisal 差异缩小），1v2 AUC 下降至 0.595，CI upper=0.604 勉强触 θ 但 CI lower=0.585 < 0.60，K*=1；(3) T=1.2 看似应增大 signal（如 Qwen exp-003 中 T=1.2 给出最高 AUC），但 Pythia 1.4B 在高温下生成质量极差（perplexity 飙升），gen-1 已经非常 noisy，gen-1→gen-2 的 marginal degradation 反而被淹没在 baseline noise 中，1v2=0.591。这揭示了 model family × decoding 的交互效应：同一 decoding strategy 在 Qwen 上保持 K*=2 但在 Pythia 上不一定。\"\n    tables:\n      - caption: \"Pythia-1.4B decoding ablation: K* determination\"\n        columns: [config, decoding, auc_1v2, ci_lower, ci_upper, k_star]\n        rows:\n          - [1, greedy, 0.6412, 0.6318, 0.6507, 2]\n          - [2, \"nucleus p=0.9\", 0.6487, 0.6392, 0.6583, 2]\n          - [3, \"T=0.7\", 0.5948, 0.5851, 0.6042, 1]\n          - [4, \"T=1.2\", 0.5912, 0.5813, 0.6008, 1]\n    figures_description:\n      - \"Paired bar chart comparing Qwen exp-003 (4/4 K*=2) vs Pythia exp-020 (2/4 K*=2). Qwen 在所有 decoding 下 1v2 AUC ∈ [0.686, 0.704]（远超 θ），Pythia 在 T=0.7 和 T=1.2 下 1v2 AUC ∈ [0.591, 0.595]（刚好在 θ 附近）。可视化 model-family × decoding 交互效应。\"\n    analysis: \"2/4 K*=2 打破了 'K* 在所有条件下不变' 的叙事。但模式有规律：Pythia 在中等 stochasticity（greedy, nuc 0.9）下 K*=2，在极端温度下 K*=1。这支持 reframing：K* 是 (model, decoding) 的函数，但对多数 practical decoding 设置仍为 2。Worst tier 下总条件计数：原 10 条件 K*=2 + 本实验 2/4 K*=2 = 12/14 K*=2（而非理想的 14/14）。\"\n\n  - name: \"Text length ablation (128/256/512 tokens)\"\n    plan_id: \"exp-021\"\n    description: \"Qwen2.5-1.5B-Instruct continuation, 128/256/512 tokens, C4 5K docs, depth 0-5\"\n    expected_results:\n      length_128:\n        k_star: 1\n        pairwise_auc: {0v1: 0.9723, 1v2: 0.5634, 2v3: 0.5218, 3v4: 0.5074, 4v5: 0.5031}\n        bootstrap_ci:\n          1v2: {auc: 0.5634, ci_lower: 0.5528, ci_upper: 0.5741, perm_p: 0.0001}\n          2v3: {auc: 0.5218, ci_lower: 0.5113, ci_upper: 0.5322, perm_p: 0.0021}\n      length_256:\n        k_star: 2\n        pairwise_auc: {0v1: 0.9891, 1v2: 0.6023, 2v3: 0.5487, 3v4: 0.5234, 4v5: 0.5098}\n        bootstrap_ci:\n          1v2: {auc: 0.6023, ci_lower: 0.5921, ci_upper: 0.6127, perm_p: 0.0001}\n          2v3: {auc: 0.5487, ci_lower: 0.5383, ci_upper: 0.5589, perm_p: 0.0001}\n      length_512:\n        k_star: 2\n        pairwise_auc: {0v1: 0.9978, 1v2: 0.6198, 2v3: 0.5623, 3v4: 0.5412, 4v5: 0.5167}\n        bootstrap_ci:\n          1v2: {auc: 0.6198, ci_lower: 0.6098, ci_upper: 0.6296, perm_p: 0.0001}\n          2v3: {auc: 0.5623, ci_lower: 0.5521, ci_upper: 0.5724, perm_p: 0.0001}\n      reference_default_length:\n        note: \"exp-017 (Qwen-cont, ~300-500 token avg) 1v2=0.6112, K*=2\"\n    result_rationale: \"128-token 文本的 K*=1 是 worst tier 的核心假设之一。信息论解释：15D 统计特征的估计精度依赖样本量（这里是 token 数）。128 tokens 下，surprisal mean/std 的估计 variance 大幅增加（√(n) 效应：128 vs 512 → variance 增大 2x），depth-driven 的微小分布偏移被估计噪声淹没。特别是 surprisal_d1/d2（差分特征）在短文本上更加 noisy。此外，128 tokens 的续写在 continuation mode 下几乎只是原文的直接延续（context window 足够覆盖全部 seed），gen-1 与 seed 的 KL divergence 更小。256 tokens 勉强恢复 K*=2（CI lower=0.592, 刚过 θ），512 tokens 与默认长度一致。这个结果说明 K*=2 的 universality 需要 'sufficient text length' 的前提条件。\"\n    tables:\n      - caption: \"Length ablation: K* as function of text length\"\n        columns: [length_tokens, auc_0v1, auc_1v2, ci_lower_1v2, ci_upper_1v2, k_star]\n        rows:\n          - [128, 0.9723, 0.5634, 0.5528, 0.5741, 1]\n          - [256, 0.9891, 0.6023, 0.5921, 0.6127, 2]\n          - [512, 0.9978, 0.6198, 0.6098, 0.6296, 2]\n          - [\"~400 (default)\", 0.9971, 0.6112, 0.6015, 0.6213, 2]\n    figures_description:\n      - \"Line plot: x=text length (log scale), y=AUC 1v2. Shows monotonic increase from 0.563 (128) to 0.620 (512). Horizontal dashed line at θ=0.60. Crossing point ~220 tokens. Shaded CI bands show 128-token CI entirely below θ.\"\n    analysis: \"128-token K*=1 是可预期的 measurement limitation，不是 fundamental 的 K* 变化。在 reframed narrative 中这是 positive：'K* measurement requires minimum text length (~200 tokens); below this, estimation noise dominates depth signal' — 这是 methodology guidance，不否定 K* 的存在。但它确实限制了实用场景（tweets、短评论等）。论文 Limitations 必须明确 scope：K*=2 characterization 适用于 ≥256 token 文本。\"\n\n  - name: \"4×4 cross-scorer matrix\"\n    plan_id: \"exp-022\"\n    description: \"4 generators (Pythia, OLMo, Qwen-cont, Qwen-7B) × 4 scorers (Pythia, OLMo, Qwen-1.5B, Qwen-7B), 验证 scorer independence\"\n    expected_results:\n      k_star_matrix:\n        # rows=generator, cols=scorer\n        Pythia_scored_by_Pythia: 2\n        Pythia_scored_by_OLMo: 2\n        Pythia_scored_by_Qwen15: 2\n        Pythia_scored_by_Qwen7B: 2\n        OLMo_scored_by_Pythia: 2\n        OLMo_scored_by_OLMo: 2\n        OLMo_scored_by_Qwen15: 2\n        OLMo_scored_by_Qwen7B: 1\n        Qwen_cont_scored_by_Pythia: 1\n        Qwen_cont_scored_by_OLMo: 1\n        Qwen_cont_scored_by_Qwen15: 2\n        Qwen_cont_scored_by_Qwen7B: 2\n        Qwen7B_scored_by_Pythia: 1\n        Qwen7B_scored_by_OLMo: 1\n        Qwen7B_scored_by_Qwen15: 2\n        Qwen7B_scored_by_Qwen7B: 2\n      kstar2_fraction: 0.625  # 10/16 = 0.625\n      kstar1_fraction: 0.375  # 6/16\n      auc_1v2_matrix:\n        Pythia_Pythia: 0.6539\n        Pythia_OLMo: 0.6312\n        Pythia_Qwen15: 0.6487\n        Pythia_Qwen7B: 0.6234\n        OLMo_Pythia: 0.6078\n        OLMo_OLMo: 0.6146\n        OLMo_Qwen15: 0.6089\n        OLMo_Qwen7B: 0.5876\n        Qwen_cont_Pythia: 0.5712\n        Qwen_cont_OLMo: 0.5648\n        Qwen_cont_Qwen15: 0.6112\n        Qwen_cont_Qwen7B: 0.6078\n        Qwen7B_Pythia: 0.5643\n        Qwen7B_OLMo: 0.5589\n        Qwen7B_Qwen15: 0.6168\n        Qwen7B_Qwen7B: 0.6245\n    result_rationale: \"Cross-scorer matrix 暴露 K* 的 scorer dependence 是 worst tier 的关键证据。模式清晰：(1) Pythia 生成的文本在任何 scorer 下都 K*=2——因为 Pythia 的 depth degradation 编码在 model-agnostic 的 surface statistics 中（high surprisal variance, TTR collapse），任何 scorer 都能捕获；(2) OLMo 类似但 OLMo→Qwen7B 刚好跌破 θ（0.588 < 0.60），边缘 K*=1；(3) Qwen-cont 和 Qwen-7B 生成的文本在 non-Qwen scorer 下 K*=1——因为 Qwen 的 depth signal 更多依赖 Qwen-specific token distribution patterns（freq_entropy 是 Qwen 的 top feature，而 Pythia/OLMo 的 top feature 是 surp_d1_std），cross-family scorer 无法 align 这些 patterns。总体 10/16=62.5% K*=2，在 worst tier 预设的 [0.4, 0.6] 范围的上端但仍暴露了 systematic scorer dependence。\"\n    tables:\n      - caption: \"4×4 K* matrix (generator × scorer)\"\n        columns: [generator, Pythia_scorer, OLMo_scorer, Qwen15_scorer, Qwen7B_scorer]\n        rows:\n          - [Pythia-1.4B, \"K*=2 (0.654)\", \"K*=2 (0.631)\", \"K*=2 (0.649)\", \"K*=2 (0.623)\"]\n          - [OLMo-1B, \"K*=2 (0.608)\", \"K*=2 (0.615)\", \"K*=2 (0.609)\", \"K*=1 (0.588)\"]\n          - [Qwen-cont, \"K*=1 (0.571)\", \"K*=1 (0.565)\", \"K*=2 (0.611)\", \"K*=2 (0.608)\"]\n          - [Qwen-7B, \"K*=1 (0.564)\", \"K*=1 (0.559)\", \"K*=2 (0.617)\", \"K*=2 (0.625)\"]\n      - caption: \"Summary statistics\"\n        columns: [metric, value]\n        rows:\n          - [total_K*=2, \"10/16 (62.5%)\"]\n          - [total_K*=1, \"6/16 (37.5%)\"]\n          - [self-scorer_K*=2, \"4/4 (100%)\"]\n          - [cross-family_K*=2, \"6/12 (50%)\"]\n          - [within-family_K*=2, \"10/10 (100%) — Pythia↔OLMo + Qwen↔Qwen\"]\n    figures_description:\n      - \"Heatmap: 4×4 grid, color = AUC 1v2 (blue=high, red=low). Clear block-diagonal structure: Pythia/OLMo block (light blue, AUC 0.61-0.65) and Qwen block (light blue, AUC 0.61-0.63). Off-diagonal cross-family cells (dark red, AUC 0.56-0.59). Annotated with K* value in each cell.\"\n    analysis: \"Cross-scorer matrix 提供了 reframing 的关键证据。Pattern 是 structured 而非 random：K*=2 在 within-family scoring 下 100% 成立，cross-family 50%。这直接支持 'K* depends on measurement setup but is bounded and predictable' 的新叙事。Specific insight：(1) Pythia/OLMo 属于同一 'family' (GPT-2 architecture, similar tokenizer sizes)，互相 scoring K*=2；(2) Qwen 是独立族，自评 K*=2 但被 Pythia/OLMo 评时 K*=1。实用含义：K*=2 在 'matched scorer' 条件下 robust，对部署者意味着 'use a scorer from the same model family as suspected generator'。\"\n\n  - name: \"Retrain-chain ecological validity\"\n    plan_id: \"exp-008\"\n    description: \"Pythia-1.4B LoRA (rank=16, alpha=32), C4 5K docs, depth 0-4. 对比 prompt-chain 和 retrain-chain 的 K* 和特征分布。\"\n    expected_results:\n      k_star: 1\n      pairwise_auc:\n        0v1: 0.9234\n        1v2: 0.5712\n        2v3: 0.5298\n        3v4: 0.5112\n      pairwise_auc_std:\n        0v1: 0.0089\n        1v2: 0.0134\n        2v3: 0.0098\n        3v4: 0.0112\n      feature_distribution_shift:\n        surp_std_jsd_vs_promptchain: 0.0823\n        freq_entropy_jsd_vs_promptchain: 0.0612\n        ttr_jsd_vs_promptchain: 0.0389\n      prompt_vs_retrain_kendall_tau: 0.58\n    result_rationale: \"Retrain-chain 是更生态有效的递归污染模型，但也更 lossy per iteration：LoRA fine-tuning 在每一代引入的 distribution shift 比 prompt-chain 更大（因为模型权重被修改），但同时 diversity 退化更快（LoRA overfits to previous generation's style）。在 worst tier 下，Pythia LoRA 的 depth-1 文本已大幅偏离 human baseline，使得 0v1 AUC 虽高 (0.923) 但低于 prompt-chain (0.993)。关键区别：retrain-chain 的退化是 'catastrophic' 的——gen-1 已经非常不同，但 gen-1→gen-2 的 marginal change 被 LoRA 的 regularization 压缩（模型收敛到 fixed point 更快）。1v2 AUC=0.571 < θ=0.60，K*=1。这并不否定 prompt-chain 的 K*=2 结果，而是说明递归污染的具体机制影响 K*。论文中定位为 'retrain-chain converges faster than prompt-chain, consistent with DPI prediction that K*_retrain ≤ K*_prompt when per-iteration information loss is greater'。\"\n    tables:\n      - caption: \"Prompt-chain vs Retrain-chain comparison (Pythia-1.4B)\"\n        columns: [depth_pair, prompt_chain_auc, retrain_chain_auc, delta]\n        rows:\n          - [0v1, 0.9932, 0.9234, \"-0.070\"]\n          - [1v2, 0.6539, 0.5712, \"-0.083\"]\n          - [2v3, 0.5515, 0.5298, \"-0.022\"]\n          - [3v4, 0.5153, 0.5112, \"-0.004\"]\n    figures_description:\n      - \"Side-by-side AUC decay curves: prompt-chain (blue) shows gentle decay with clear 1v2 signal; retrain-chain (red) shows steeper initial drop and faster convergence to chance. Dashed θ=0.60 line crossed by blue at depth 2-3, by red at depth 1-2.\"\n    analysis: \"Retrain-chain K*=1 在 reframed narrative 中是 feature 而非 bug：它验证了 'per-iteration information loss rate determines K*' 的理论预测。更大的 per-step loss → 更小的 K* → 更快收敛到 indistinguishable。这支持 DPI framework 的 explanatory power：K* 不是 magic constant，而是信道容量的函数。\"\n\n  - name: \"Contamination dose-response\"\n    plan_id: \"exp-009\"\n    description: \"10%/30%/50% synthetic injection 比例下 graduated vs binary filtering 收益差异\"\n    expected_results:\n      dose_10pct:\n        binary_ours_mmlu: 0.5987\n        graduated_a09_mmlu: 0.5981\n        no_filter_mmlu: 0.5962\n        delta_binary_vs_nofilter: 0.0025\n      dose_30pct:\n        binary_ours_mmlu: 0.5941\n        graduated_a09_mmlu: 0.5892\n        no_filter_mmlu: 0.5865\n        delta_binary_vs_nofilter: 0.0076\n      dose_50pct:\n        binary_ours_mmlu: 0.5878\n        graduated_a09_mmlu: 0.5834\n        no_filter_mmlu: 0.5791\n        delta_binary_vs_nofilter: 0.0087\n      key_pattern: \"binary-ours > graduated at all doses; filtering benefit increases with contamination level\"\n    result_rationale: \"在 worst tier 下 K*=2 仍然在自评条件下成立（已完成实验不变），所以 binary filtering 的优势机制不受影响：K*=2 意味着 depth≥2 的文本与 depth-1 几乎不可区分，graduated weighting 对 depth≥2 分配不同权重无意义，binary cutoff 是信息论最优。Dose-response 展示 linear scaling：10% 注入时效果差异小（所有方法接近 base），50% 时 binary 优势放大（更多需要过滤的文本 → filtering precision 更重要）。这个实验结果在 worst/best tier 间差异不大，因为 C3 claim 不依赖 universality——只需要 binary > graduated，which holds whenever K*≤2 for the given generator-scorer pair。\"\n    tables:\n      - caption: \"Dose-response: MMLU by contamination level and filtering strategy\"\n        columns: [dose, no_filter, graduated_a09, binary_ours, Δ(binary-nofilter)]\n        rows:\n          - [\"10%\", 0.5962, 0.5981, 0.5987, \"+0.0025\"]\n          - [\"30%\", 0.5865, 0.5892, 0.5941, \"+0.0076\"]\n          - [\"50%\", 0.5791, 0.5834, 0.5878, \"+0.0087\"]\n    figures_description:\n      - \"Line plot: x=contamination dose, y=MMLU. Three lines (no-filter declining steeply, graduated declining moderately, binary declining least). Gap between binary and no-filter widens with dose.\"\n    analysis: \"Dose-response 是 C3 的 robustness check。在 worst tier 下结论不变：binary filtering 在所有 dose 下 ≥ graduated。更重要的是，这个实验不依赖 universality claim，所以 reframing 不影响它。但措辞需调整：从 'K*=2 universally predicts binary optimality' 到 'for matched generator-scorer conditions where K*=2, binary filtering is optimal; for mismatched conditions where K*=1, even binary detection may be unreliable'。\"\n\n  - name: \"Domain ablation (Wikipedia seeds)\"\n    plan_id: \"exp-023\"\n    description: \"Wikipedia seed data, Qwen2.5-1.5B (base) continuation mode, nucleus p=0.95 T=1.0, 5K docs, depth 0-5, scorer=Qwen2.5-1.5B\"\n    expected_results:\n      k_star: 2\n      pairwise_auc:\n        0v1: 0.9834\n        1v2: 0.6056\n        2v3: 0.5412\n        3v4: 0.5187\n        4v5: 0.5078\n      bootstrap_ci:\n        1v2: {auc: 0.6056, ci_lower: 0.5953, ci_upper: 0.6158, perm_p: 0.0001}\n        2v3: {auc: 0.5412, ci_lower: 0.5312, ci_upper: 0.5513, perm_p: 0.0001}\n      pairwise_jsd:\n        0v1: 0.1523\n        1v2: 0.0078\n        2v3: 0.0041\n        3v4: 0.0028\n        4v5: 0.0022\n      ordinal_mae: 1.23\n      ordinal_accuracy: 0.3512\n    result_rationale: \"Wikipedia vs C4 的对比在 worst tier 下是 marginal K*=2（CI lower=0.5953 < 0.60，判定边缘）。Wikipedia 文本比 C4 更 structured（longer sentences, more formal register, less noise），Qwen 对 Wikipedia-style 续写的质量更高（training data 中 Wikipedia 比例大），depth-1 文本与 human Wikipedia 的差距更小。但因为是 self-scoring（Qwen→Qwen），仍 K*=2——though barely。Worst tier 下 CI lower=0.5953 实际上使这个结果 ambiguous（θ=0.60 定义下 technically K*=1）。选择报告为 K*=2（point estimate > 0.60）但 acknowledge CI lower < θ。这是 worst tier 的 boundary case：domain 选择影响 signal strength，Wikipedia 比 C4 更难但不足以翻转结论（在自评条件下）。\"\n    tables:\n      - caption: \"Domain comparison: C4 vs Wikipedia (Qwen-1.5B base, self-scoring)\"\n        columns: [domain, auc_0v1, auc_1v2, ci_lower_1v2, k_star, note]\n        rows:\n          - [C4, 0.9971, 0.6112, 0.6015, 2, \"exp-017 reference\"]\n          - [Wikipedia, 0.9834, 0.6056, 0.5953, \"2 (marginal)\", \"CI lower < θ\"]\n    figures_description:\n      - \"Paired AUC decay curves for C4 (solid) and Wikipedia (dashed). Wikipedia consistently ~0.5-1pp lower at each depth pair. Both cross θ between 1v2 and 2v3, but Wikipedia's 1v2 CI band straddles θ=0.60.\"\n    analysis: \"Wikipedia 的 marginal 结果在 worst tier 中增加了 limitation disclosure 的负担：'K*=2 characterization is robust for C4 web text but approaches measurement limits for more structured domains like Wikipedia'。在 reframed narrative 中这反而是 good evidence for the framework：K* 取决于 (model, domain, scorer) tuple，Wikipedia 的 higher quality → smaller per-generation information loss → K* 趋向 1。DPI framework predicts this correctly。\"\n\n  - name: \"Naturalistic validation (Common Crawl)\"\n    plan_id: \"exp-014\"\n    description: \"Common Crawl 2025/2026 snapshot 样本做 depth 预测，与 AlignScore 和 vocabulary richness 指标做 correlation\"\n    expected_results:\n      n_samples: 10000\n      predicted_depth_distribution:\n        depth_0: 0.72\n        depth_1: 0.18\n        depth_2: 0.07\n        depth_3_plus: 0.03\n      correlation_with_alignscore:\n        spearman_rho: -0.31\n        p_value: 0.0001\n      correlation_with_vocab_richness:\n        ttr_spearman: -0.28\n        hapax_spearman: -0.25\n      key_caveat: \"no ground truth depth labels — correlational only\"\n    result_rationale: \"Naturalistic validation 在 worst tier 下仍有信息量但 claim 弱化。OBD classifier 对 Common Crawl 文本做 depth prediction：大部分为 depth-0 (human)，~18% 预测为 depth-1（consistent with 估计的 web synthetic content 比例），few depth-2+。与 AlignScore（factual consistency）的 negative correlation（ρ=-0.31）说明 predicted deeper text 确实质量更低，但 correlation 弱（<0.5）且无 ground truth。在 worst tier 下 cross-family K*=1 意味着 classifier 可能 misclassify cross-family 生成文本为 depth-0，underestimating 污染比例。论文中只能 claim 'OBD predictions correlate with independent quality proxies' 而不能 claim 'accurate depth estimation in the wild'。\"\n    tables: []\n    figures_description:\n      - \"Scatter plot: x=OBD predicted depth, y=AlignScore (jittered). Mild negative trend. Violin plots showing vocab richness distributions per predicted depth — depth-0 highest, depth-1 lower, depth-2+ lowest.\"\n    analysis: \"在 reframed narrative 中，naturalistic validation 的 role 变为 'demonstrating practical applicability of the characterization framework' 而非 'proving K*=2 in the wild'。Key limitation 必须 acknowledge：cross-family scorer dependence 意味着 OBD 可能 miss 来自不同 model family 的 synthetic text。这激励 future work on family-adaptive scoring。\"\n\n# Worst tier 总结统计\nsummary:\n  total_conditions_tested: 18  # 10 original + 2 Pythia decoding K*=2 + 2 Pythia decoding K*=1 + LLaMA + Mistral + length 128 + length 256/512\n  total_kstar_2: 12  # 10 original + 2 Pythia decoding (greedy/nuc)\n  total_kstar_ne_2: 5  # LLaMA K*=1, Mistral K*=1, Pythia T=0.7 K*=1, Pythia T=1.2 K*=1, 128-token K*=1\n  cross_scorer_kstar2_fraction: 0.625  # 10/16\n  narrative_status: \"Universal K*=2 → bounded K*∈{1,2,3} dependent on (model family, scorer family, text length)\"\n  headline_result: \"First systematic measurement of K*; bounded ≤3; predictable from model-scorer family match\"\n  c1_impact: \"降级为 characterization methodology contribution\"\n  c3_impact: \"不受影响（binary > graduated 在所有 K*≤2 条件下成立）\"\n  venue_risk: \"EMNLP main 仍可行（methodology + framework novelty），但从 oral candidate 降为 poster/findings 风险增大\"\n```"}],"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":33100,"cache_read_input_tokens":11841,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":33100},"output_tokens":9,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"not_available"},"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"5c70739c-9299-48de-8236-13269acff92e","uuid":"09bfec9a-ea5f-44e9-bbb7-4753ab3f2642"}
{"type":"result","subtype":"success","is_error":false,"api_error_status":null,"duration_ms":230321,"duration_api_ms":231902,"num_turns":1,"result":"```yaml\ntier: worst\nnarrative_guidance: \"放弃 'universal K*=2' 作为 headline。Reframe 为 'K* as a model-family-dependent characterization quantity'：K*∈{1,2,3} 取决于 (architecture, scale, representation) 三元组，但 K*≤3 是 DPI-bounded universal upper limit。新 headline result 变为 'We provide the first systematic measurement of K* and reveal it is bounded, small (≤3), and predictable from model family properties'。\"\n\nimagined_experiments:\n  - name: \"LLaMA-3.1-8B cross-family depth chain\"\n    plan_id: \"exp-018\"\n    description: \"LLaMA-3.1-8B, continuation mode, nucleus p=0.95 T=1.0, C4 5K docs, depth 0-5, scorer=Qwen2.5-1.5B\"\n    expected_results:\n      k_star: 1\n      pairwise_auc:\n        0v1: 0.9812\n        1v2: 0.5783\n        2v3: 0.5341\n        3v4: 0.5128\n        4v5: 0.5067\n      pairwise_auc_std:\n        0v1: 0.0028\n        1v2: 0.0095\n        2v3: 0.0072\n        3v4: 0.0088\n        4v5: 0.0063\n      bootstrap_ci:\n        0v1: {auc: 0.9812, ci_lower: 0.9779, ci_upper: 0.9843, perm_p: 0.0001}\n        1v2: {auc: 0.5783, ci_lower: 0.5688, ci_upper: 0.5879, perm_p: 0.0001}\n        2v3: {auc: 0.5341, ci_lower: 0.5243, ci_upper: 0.5438, perm_p: 0.0003}\n        3v4: {auc: 0.5128, ci_lower: 0.5024, ci_upper: 0.5231, perm_p: 0.0312}\n        4v5: {auc: 0.5067, ci_lower: 0.4963, ci_upper: 0.5172, perm_p: 0.1423}\n      pairwise_jsd:\n        0v1: 0.1583\n        1v2: 0.0062\n        2v3: 0.0034\n        3v4: 0.0025\n        4v5: 0.0019\n      ordinal_mae: 1.31\n      ordinal_accuracy: 0.3241\n      top_features: [surp_std, freq_entropy, surp_d1_mean, surp_skew, ttr]\n    result_rationale: \"LLaMA-3.1-8B 的 tokenizer（BPE 128K vocab）与 Qwen-1.5B scorer 的 tokenizer 不匹配程度远大于 Qwen-7B→Qwen-1.5B（同族）。Cross-family scoring 引入 tokenization mismatch：LLaMA 生成文本的 token boundary 与 Qwen scorer 的 surprisal 计算不对齐，导致 surprisal-based features 的 depth-discriminative signal 被系统性削弱。8B 规模模型的 continuation 质量更高（更接近 human text），depth-1 文本本身退化更小，使得 1v2 区分更难。1v2 AUC=0.578 < θ=0.60，CI upper=0.5879 < 0.60，判定 K*=1。这不是说 LLaMA 没有 depth signal，而是 cross-family scorer 无法捕获它——K* 依赖于 (generator, scorer) pair。\"\n    tables:\n      - caption: \"LLaMA-8B pairwise AUC with bootstrap CI (scorer=Qwen-1.5B)\"\n        columns: [depth_pair, auc, ci_lower, ci_upper, perm_p, \"passes_θ=0.60\"]\n        rows:\n          - [0v1, 0.9812, 0.9779, 0.9843, 0.0001, \"✅\"]\n          - [1v2, 0.5783, 0.5688, 0.5879, 0.0001, \"❌ (CI upper < 0.60)\"]\n          - [2v3, 0.5341, 0.5243, 0.5438, 0.0003, \"❌\"]\n          - [3v4, 0.5128, 0.5024, 0.5231, 0.0312, \"❌\"]\n          - [4v5, 0.5067, 0.4963, 0.5172, 0.1423, \"❌\"]\n    figures_description:\n      - \"AUC decay curve: steep drop from 0v1 (0.98) to 1v2 (0.578), then near-chance plateau from 2v3 onward. Compared to Qwen-7B (same scale, same scorer) which shows 1v2=0.618, LLaMA drops ~4pp — the cross-family gap.\"\n    analysis: \"K*=1 结论意味着 Qwen-1.5B scorer 在 LLaMA-8B 生成链上仅能区分 human vs gen-1，无法区分 gen-1 vs gen-2。这与 exp-004（Qwen-7B, 同族 scorer, K*=2）形成对比，暴露 K* 的 scorer-dependence。如果用 LLaMA 自身做 scorer 可能恢复 K*=2，但实验设计使用 fixed scorer 以测试 universality——结果否定了 scorer-independent universality。\"\n\n  - name: \"Mistral-7B cross-family depth chain\"\n    plan_id: \"exp-019\"\n    description: \"Mistral-7B-v0.3, continuation mode, nucleus p=0.95 T=1.0, C4 5K docs, depth 0-5, scorer=Qwen2.5-1.5B\"\n    expected_results:\n      k_star: 1\n      pairwise_auc:\n        0v1: 0.9756\n        1v2: 0.5692\n        2v3: 0.5287\n        3v4: 0.5095\n        4v5: 0.5042\n      pairwise_auc_std:\n        0v1: 0.0031\n        1v2: 0.0103\n        2v3: 0.0068\n        3v4: 0.0091\n        4v5: 0.0074\n      bootstrap_ci:\n        0v1: {auc: 0.9756, ci_lower: 0.9718, ci_upper: 0.9791, perm_p: 0.0001}\n        1v2: {auc: 0.5692, ci_lower: 0.5591, ci_upper: 0.5794, perm_p: 0.0001}\n        2v3: {auc: 0.5287, ci_lower: 0.5189, ci_upper: 0.5384, perm_p: 0.0008}\n        3v4: {auc: 0.5095, ci_lower: 0.4988, ci_upper: 0.5198, perm_p: 0.0891}\n        4v5: {auc: 0.5042, ci_lower: 0.4937, ci_upper: 0.5148, perm_p: 0.2341}\n      pairwise_jsd:\n        0v1: 0.1421\n        1v2: 0.0054\n        2v3: 0.0029\n        3v4: 0.0021\n        4v5: 0.0016\n      ordinal_mae: 1.35\n      ordinal_accuracy: 0.3118\n      top_features: [freq_entropy, surp_std, surp_d1_skew, surp_mean, hapax_ratio]\n    result_rationale: \"Mistral-7B 使用 sliding window attention (SWA, window=4096)，其 continuation 生成的文本在局部 coherence 上与 human text 更相似（SWA 限制了长距离 dependency 退化的速度），同时 Mistral 的 32K vocab BPE tokenizer 与 Qwen 的 151K vocab tokenizer 差异极大。这双重因素使 cross-family scorer 信号更弱：(1) Mistral 生成质量退化本身更缓慢（SWA 架构特性），(2) tokenizer mismatch 进一步削弱 surprisal features 的 discriminative power。1v2 AUC=0.569, CI upper=0.579 < 0.60，K*=1。Mistral 比 LLaMA 还低 ~1pp，因为 SWA 使得 depth-1 和 depth-2 文本在 surface statistics 上更相似。\"\n    tables:\n      - caption: \"Mistral-7B pairwise AUC with bootstrap CI (scorer=Qwen-1.5B)\"\n        columns: [depth_pair, auc, ci_lower, ci_upper, perm_p, \"passes_θ=0.60\"]\n        rows:\n          - [0v1, 0.9756, 0.9718, 0.9791, 0.0001, \"✅\"]\n          - [1v2, 0.5692, 0.5591, 0.5794, 0.0001, \"❌ (CI upper < 0.60)\"]\n          - [2v3, 0.5287, 0.5189, 0.5384, 0.0008, \"❌\"]\n          - [3v4, 0.5095, 0.4988, 0.5198, 0.0891, \"❌\"]\n          - [4v5, 0.5042, 0.4937, 0.5148, 0.2341, \"❌\"]\n    figures_description:\n      - \"AUC decay curve 与 LLaMA-8B 类似但更低。0v1 处 AUC 也略低（0.976 vs LLaMA 0.981），说明 Mistral 生成的 gen-0→gen-1 信号在 Qwen scorer 下也被轻微压制。3v4 和 4v5 已无显著性（p>0.05）。\"\n    analysis: \"Mistral K*=1 确认了 worst tier 核心假设。两个 7B+ cross-family 模型均 K*=1，与已有的 ≤1.5B 自评 K*=2 形成系统性分裂。但注意：0v1 AUC 仍 >0.97，binary detection 能力未受影响——K*=1 只意味着 'depth estimation beyond binary 在 cross-family scoring 下失败'，不影响实用的 binary contamination detection。这恰好支持 reframing：K* 取决于 measurement setup，但 K*≤3 作为上界是 robust 的。\"\n\n  - name: \"Pythia-1.4B decoding strategy ablation\"\n    plan_id: \"exp-020\"\n    description: \"Pythia-1.4B, greedy / nucleus p=0.9 / T=0.7 / T=1.2, C4 5K docs, depth 0-5\"\n    expected_results:\n      config1_greedy:\n        k_star: 2\n        pairwise_auc: {0v1: 0.9891, 1v2: 0.6412, 2v3: 0.5423, 3v4: 0.5134, 4v5: 0.5078}\n        bootstrap_ci:\n          1v2: {auc: 0.6412, ci_lower: 0.6318, ci_upper: 0.6507, perm_p: 0.0001}\n          2v3: {auc: 0.5423, ci_lower: 0.5324, ci_upper: 0.5521, perm_p: 0.0001}\n      config2_nuc09:\n        k_star: 2\n        pairwise_auc: {0v1: 0.9918, 1v2: 0.6487, 2v3: 0.5478, 3v4: 0.5156, 4v5: 0.5091}\n        bootstrap_ci:\n          1v2: {auc: 0.6487, ci_lower: 0.6392, ci_upper: 0.6583, perm_p: 0.0001}\n          2v3: {auc: 0.5478, ci_lower: 0.5379, ci_upper: 0.5576, perm_p: 0.0001}\n      config3_t07:\n        k_star: 1\n        pairwise_auc: {0v1: 0.9873, 1v2: 0.5948, 2v3: 0.5389, 3v4: 0.5112, 4v5: 0.5054}\n        bootstrap_ci:\n          1v2: {auc: 0.5948, ci_lower: 0.5851, ci_upper: 0.6042, perm_p: 0.0001}\n          2v3: {auc: 0.5389, ci_lower: 0.5291, ci_upper: 0.5488, perm_p: 0.0001}\n      config4_t12:\n        k_star: 1\n        pairwise_auc: {0v1: 0.9953, 1v2: 0.5912, 2v3: 0.5512, 3v4: 0.5198, 4v5: 0.5123}\n        bootstrap_ci:\n          1v2: {auc: 0.5912, ci_lower: 0.5813, ci_upper: 0.6008, perm_p: 0.0001}\n          2v3: {auc: 0.5512, ci_lower: 0.5412, ci_upper: 0.5611, perm_p: 0.0001}\n      overall_kstar2_count: \"2/4\"\n    result_rationale: \"Worst tier 假设 Pythia decoding 2/4 K*=2（模型族 × 解码交互效应）。Pythia-1.4B 自评在 exp-001（nucleus p=0.95 T=1.0）给出 K*=2，AUC 1v2=0.654。但不同 decoding 下：(1) Greedy 和 nucleus p=0.9 保持 K*=2，因为它们的 stochasticity 与 exp-001 原始条件相近（greedy 减少了 noise 但也减少了 diversity → depth signal 在 surprisal features 上仍可捕获；nucleus 0.9 与 0.95 差异小）；(2) T=0.7 使得生成文本 diversity 降低，gen-1 和 gen-2 的 surface statistics 更相似（低温度 → 更 deterministic → token distribution 变窄 → surprisal 差异缩小），1v2 AUC 下降至 0.595，CI upper=0.604 勉强触 θ 但 CI lower=0.585 < 0.60，K*=1；(3) T=1.2 看似应增大 signal（如 Qwen exp-003 中 T=1.2 给出最高 AUC），但 Pythia 1.4B 在高温下生成质量极差（perplexity 飙升），gen-1 已经非常 noisy，gen-1→gen-2 的 marginal degradation 反而被淹没在 baseline noise 中，1v2=0.591。这揭示了 model family × decoding 的交互效应：同一 decoding strategy 在 Qwen 上保持 K*=2 但在 Pythia 上不一定。\"\n    tables:\n      - caption: \"Pythia-1.4B decoding ablation: K* determination\"\n        columns: [config, decoding, auc_1v2, ci_lower, ci_upper, k_star]\n        rows:\n          - [1, greedy, 0.6412, 0.6318, 0.6507, 2]\n          - [2, \"nucleus p=0.9\", 0.6487, 0.6392, 0.6583, 2]\n          - [3, \"T=0.7\", 0.5948, 0.5851, 0.6042, 1]\n          - [4, \"T=1.2\", 0.5912, 0.5813, 0.6008, 1]\n    figures_description:\n      - \"Paired bar chart comparing Qwen exp-003 (4/4 K*=2) vs Pythia exp-020 (2/4 K*=2). Qwen 在所有 decoding 下 1v2 AUC ∈ [0.686, 0.704]（远超 θ），Pythia 在 T=0.7 和 T=1.2 下 1v2 AUC ∈ [0.591, 0.595]（刚好在 θ 附近）。可视化 model-family × decoding 交互效应。\"\n    analysis: \"2/4 K*=2 打破了 'K* 在所有条件下不变' 的叙事。但模式有规律：Pythia 在中等 stochasticity（greedy, nuc 0.9）下 K*=2，在极端温度下 K*=1。这支持 reframing：K* 是 (model, decoding) 的函数，但对多数 practical decoding 设置仍为 2。Worst tier 下总条件计数：原 10 条件 K*=2 + 本实验 2/4 K*=2 = 12/14 K*=2（而非理想的 14/14）。\"\n\n  - name: \"Text length ablation (128/256/512 tokens)\"\n    plan_id: \"exp-021\"\n    description: \"Qwen2.5-1.5B-Instruct continuation, 128/256/512 tokens, C4 5K docs, depth 0-5\"\n    expected_results:\n      length_128:\n        k_star: 1\n        pairwise_auc: {0v1: 0.9723, 1v2: 0.5634, 2v3: 0.5218, 3v4: 0.5074, 4v5: 0.5031}\n        bootstrap_ci:\n          1v2: {auc: 0.5634, ci_lower: 0.5528, ci_upper: 0.5741, perm_p: 0.0001}\n          2v3: {auc: 0.5218, ci_lower: 0.5113, ci_upper: 0.5322, perm_p: 0.0021}\n      length_256:\n        k_star: 2\n        pairwise_auc: {0v1: 0.9891, 1v2: 0.6023, 2v3: 0.5487, 3v4: 0.5234, 4v5: 0.5098}\n        bootstrap_ci:\n          1v2: {auc: 0.6023, ci_lower: 0.5921, ci_upper: 0.6127, perm_p: 0.0001}\n          2v3: {auc: 0.5487, ci_lower: 0.5383, ci_upper: 0.5589, perm_p: 0.0001}\n      length_512:\n        k_star: 2\n        pairwise_auc: {0v1: 0.9978, 1v2: 0.6198, 2v3: 0.5623, 3v4: 0.5412, 4v5: 0.5167}\n        bootstrap_ci:\n          1v2: {auc: 0.6198, ci_lower: 0.6098, ci_upper: 0.6296, perm_p: 0.0001}\n          2v3: {auc: 0.5623, ci_lower: 0.5521, ci_upper: 0.5724, perm_p: 0.0001}\n      reference_default_length:\n        note: \"exp-017 (Qwen-cont, ~300-500 token avg) 1v2=0.6112, K*=2\"\n    result_rationale: \"128-token 文本的 K*=1 是 worst tier 的核心假设之一。信息论解释：15D 统计特征的估计精度依赖样本量（这里是 token 数）。128 tokens 下，surprisal mean/std 的估计 variance 大幅增加（√(n) 效应：128 vs 512 → variance 增大 2x），depth-driven 的微小分布偏移被估计噪声淹没。特别是 surprisal_d1/d2（差分特征）在短文本上更加 noisy。此外，128 tokens 的续写在 continuation mode 下几乎只是原文的直接延续（context window 足够覆盖全部 seed），gen-1 与 seed 的 KL divergence 更小。256 tokens 勉强恢复 K*=2（CI lower=0.592, 刚过 θ），512 tokens 与默认长度一致。这个结果说明 K*=2 的 universality 需要 'sufficient text length' 的前提条件。\"\n    tables:\n      - caption: \"Length ablation: K* as function of text length\"\n        columns: [length_tokens, auc_0v1, auc_1v2, ci_lower_1v2, ci_upper_1v2, k_star]\n        rows:\n          - [128, 0.9723, 0.5634, 0.5528, 0.5741, 1]\n          - [256, 0.9891, 0.6023, 0.5921, 0.6127, 2]\n          - [512, 0.9978, 0.6198, 0.6098, 0.6296, 2]\n          - [\"~400 (default)\", 0.9971, 0.6112, 0.6015, 0.6213, 2]\n    figures_description:\n      - \"Line plot: x=text length (log scale), y=AUC 1v2. Shows monotonic increase from 0.563 (128) to 0.620 (512). Horizontal dashed line at θ=0.60. Crossing point ~220 tokens. Shaded CI bands show 128-token CI entirely below θ.\"\n    analysis: \"128-token K*=1 是可预期的 measurement limitation，不是 fundamental 的 K* 变化。在 reframed narrative 中这是 positive：'K* measurement requires minimum text length (~200 tokens); below this, estimation noise dominates depth signal' — 这是 methodology guidance，不否定 K* 的存在。但它确实限制了实用场景（tweets、短评论等）。论文 Limitations 必须明确 scope：K*=2 characterization 适用于 ≥256 token 文本。\"\n\n  - name: \"4×4 cross-scorer matrix\"\n    plan_id: \"exp-022\"\n    description: \"4 generators (Pythia, OLMo, Qwen-cont, Qwen-7B) × 4 scorers (Pythia, OLMo, Qwen-1.5B, Qwen-7B), 验证 scorer independence\"\n    expected_results:\n      k_star_matrix:\n        # rows=generator, cols=scorer\n        Pythia_scored_by_Pythia: 2\n        Pythia_scored_by_OLMo: 2\n        Pythia_scored_by_Qwen15: 2\n        Pythia_scored_by_Qwen7B: 2\n        OLMo_scored_by_Pythia: 2\n        OLMo_scored_by_OLMo: 2\n        OLMo_scored_by_Qwen15: 2\n        OLMo_scored_by_Qwen7B: 1\n        Qwen_cont_scored_by_Pythia: 1\n        Qwen_cont_scored_by_OLMo: 1\n        Qwen_cont_scored_by_Qwen15: 2\n        Qwen_cont_scored_by_Qwen7B: 2\n        Qwen7B_scored_by_Pythia: 1\n        Qwen7B_scored_by_OLMo: 1\n        Qwen7B_scored_by_Qwen15: 2\n        Qwen7B_scored_by_Qwen7B: 2\n      kstar2_fraction: 0.625  # 10/16 = 0.625\n      kstar1_fraction: 0.375  # 6/16\n      auc_1v2_matrix:\n        Pythia_Pythia: 0.6539\n        Pythia_OLMo: 0.6312\n        Pythia_Qwen15: 0.6487\n        Pythia_Qwen7B: 0.6234\n        OLMo_Pythia: 0.6078\n        OLMo_OLMo: 0.6146\n        OLMo_Qwen15: 0.6089\n        OLMo_Qwen7B: 0.5876\n        Qwen_cont_Pythia: 0.5712\n        Qwen_cont_OLMo: 0.5648\n        Qwen_cont_Qwen15: 0.6112\n        Qwen_cont_Qwen7B: 0.6078\n        Qwen7B_Pythia: 0.5643\n        Qwen7B_OLMo: 0.5589\n        Qwen7B_Qwen15: 0.6168\n        Qwen7B_Qwen7B: 0.6245\n    result_rationale: \"Cross-scorer matrix 暴露 K* 的 scorer dependence 是 worst tier 的关键证据。模式清晰：(1) Pythia 生成的文本在任何 scorer 下都 K*=2——因为 Pythia 的 depth degradation 编码在 model-agnostic 的 surface statistics 中（high surprisal variance, TTR collapse），任何 scorer 都能捕获；(2) OLMo 类似但 OLMo→Qwen7B 刚好跌破 θ（0.588 < 0.60），边缘 K*=1；(3) Qwen-cont 和 Qwen-7B 生成的文本在 non-Qwen scorer 下 K*=1——因为 Qwen 的 depth signal 更多依赖 Qwen-specific token distribution patterns（freq_entropy 是 Qwen 的 top feature，而 Pythia/OLMo 的 top feature 是 surp_d1_std），cross-family scorer 无法 align 这些 patterns。总体 10/16=62.5% K*=2，在 worst tier 预设的 [0.4, 0.6] 范围的上端但仍暴露了 systematic scorer dependence。\"\n    tables:\n      - caption: \"4×4 K* matrix (generator × scorer)\"\n        columns: [generator, Pythia_scorer, OLMo_scorer, Qwen15_scorer, Qwen7B_scorer]\n        rows:\n          - [Pythia-1.4B, \"K*=2 (0.654)\", \"K*=2 (0.631)\", \"K*=2 (0.649)\", \"K*=2 (0.623)\"]\n          - [OLMo-1B, \"K*=2 (0.608)\", \"K*=2 (0.615)\", \"K*=2 (0.609)\", \"K*=1 (0.588)\"]\n          - [Qwen-cont, \"K*=1 (0.571)\", \"K*=1 (0.565)\", \"K*=2 (0.611)\", \"K*=2 (0.608)\"]\n          - [Qwen-7B, \"K*=1 (0.564)\", \"K*=1 (0.559)\", \"K*=2 (0.617)\", \"K*=2 (0.625)\"]\n      - caption: \"Summary statistics\"\n        columns: [metric, value]\n        rows:\n          - [total_K*=2, \"10/16 (62.5%)\"]\n          - [total_K*=1, \"6/16 (37.5%)\"]\n          - [self-scorer_K*=2, \"4/4 (100%)\"]\n          - [cross-family_K*=2, \"6/12 (50%)\"]\n          - [within-family_K*=2, \"10/10 (100%) — Pythia↔OLMo + Qwen↔Qwen\"]\n    figures_description:\n      - \"Heatmap: 4×4 grid, color = AUC 1v2 (blue=high, red=low). Clear block-diagonal structure: Pythia/OLMo block (light blue, AUC 0.61-0.65) and Qwen block (light blue, AUC 0.61-0.63). Off-diagonal cross-family cells (dark red, AUC 0.56-0.59). Annotated with K* value in each cell.\"\n    analysis: \"Cross-scorer matrix 提供了 reframing 的关键证据。Pattern 是 structured 而非 random：K*=2 在 within-family scoring 下 100% 成立，cross-family 50%。这直接支持 'K* depends on measurement setup but is bounded and predictable' 的新叙事。Specific insight：(1) Pythia/OLMo 属于同一 'family' (GPT-2 architecture, similar tokenizer sizes)，互相 scoring K*=2；(2) Qwen 是独立族，自评 K*=2 但被 Pythia/OLMo 评时 K*=1。实用含义：K*=2 在 'matched scorer' 条件下 robust，对部署者意味着 'use a scorer from the same model family as suspected generator'。\"\n\n  - name: \"Retrain-chain ecological validity\"\n    plan_id: \"exp-008\"\n    description: \"Pythia-1.4B LoRA (rank=16, alpha=32), C4 5K docs, depth 0-4. 对比 prompt-chain 和 retrain-chain 的 K* 和特征分布。\"\n    expected_results:\n      k_star: 1\n      pairwise_auc:\n        0v1: 0.9234\n        1v2: 0.5712\n        2v3: 0.5298\n        3v4: 0.5112\n      pairwise_auc_std:\n        0v1: 0.0089\n        1v2: 0.0134\n        2v3: 0.0098\n        3v4: 0.0112\n      feature_distribution_shift:\n        surp_std_jsd_vs_promptchain: 0.0823\n        freq_entropy_jsd_vs_promptchain: 0.0612\n        ttr_jsd_vs_promptchain: 0.0389\n      prompt_vs_retrain_kendall_tau: 0.58\n    result_rationale: \"Retrain-chain 是更生态有效的递归污染模型，但也更 lossy per iteration：LoRA fine-tuning 在每一代引入的 distribution shift 比 prompt-chain 更大（因为模型权重被修改），但同时 diversity 退化更快（LoRA overfits to previous generation's style）。在 worst tier 下，Pythia LoRA 的 depth-1 文本已大幅偏离 human baseline，使得 0v1 AUC 虽高 (0.923) 但低于 prompt-chain (0.993)。关键区别：retrain-chain 的退化是 'catastrophic' 的——gen-1 已经非常不同，但 gen-1→gen-2 的 marginal change 被 LoRA 的 regularization 压缩（模型收敛到 fixed point 更快）。1v2 AUC=0.571 < θ=0.60，K*=1。这并不否定 prompt-chain 的 K*=2 结果，而是说明递归污染的具体机制影响 K*。论文中定位为 'retrain-chain converges faster than prompt-chain, consistent with DPI prediction that K*_retrain ≤ K*_prompt when per-iteration information loss is greater'。\"\n    tables:\n      - caption: \"Prompt-chain vs Retrain-chain comparison (Pythia-1.4B)\"\n        columns: [depth_pair, prompt_chain_auc, retrain_chain_auc, delta]\n        rows:\n          - [0v1, 0.9932, 0.9234, \"-0.070\"]\n          - [1v2, 0.6539, 0.5712, \"-0.083\"]\n          - [2v3, 0.5515, 0.5298, \"-0.022\"]\n          - [3v4, 0.5153, 0.5112, \"-0.004\"]\n    figures_description:\n      - \"Side-by-side AUC decay curves: prompt-chain (blue) shows gentle decay with clear 1v2 signal; retrain-chain (red) shows steeper initial drop and faster convergence to chance. Dashed θ=0.60 line crossed by blue at depth 2-3, by red at depth 1-2.\"\n    analysis: \"Retrain-chain K*=1 在 reframed narrative 中是 feature 而非 bug：它验证了 'per-iteration information loss rate determines K*' 的理论预测。更大的 per-step loss → 更小的 K* → 更快收敛到 indistinguishable。这支持 DPI framework 的 explanatory power：K* 不是 magic constant，而是信道容量的函数。\"\n\n  - name: \"Contamination dose-response\"\n    plan_id: \"exp-009\"\n    description: \"10%/30%/50% synthetic injection 比例下 graduated vs binary filtering 收益差异\"\n    expected_results:\n      dose_10pct:\n        binary_ours_mmlu: 0.5987\n        graduated_a09_mmlu: 0.5981\n        no_filter_mmlu: 0.5962\n        delta_binary_vs_nofilter: 0.0025\n      dose_30pct:\n        binary_ours_mmlu: 0.5941\n        graduated_a09_mmlu: 0.5892\n        no_filter_mmlu: 0.5865\n        delta_binary_vs_nofilter: 0.0076\n      dose_50pct:\n        binary_ours_mmlu: 0.5878\n        graduated_a09_mmlu: 0.5834\n        no_filter_mmlu: 0.5791\n        delta_binary_vs_nofilter: 0.0087\n      key_pattern: \"binary-ours > graduated at all doses; filtering benefit increases with contamination level\"\n    result_rationale: \"在 worst tier 下 K*=2 仍然在自评条件下成立（已完成实验不变），所以 binary filtering 的优势机制不受影响：K*=2 意味着 depth≥2 的文本与 depth-1 几乎不可区分，graduated weighting 对 depth≥2 分配不同权重无意义，binary cutoff 是信息论最优。Dose-response 展示 linear scaling：10% 注入时效果差异小（所有方法接近 base），50% 时 binary 优势放大（更多需要过滤的文本 → filtering precision 更重要）。这个实验结果在 worst/best tier 间差异不大，因为 C3 claim 不依赖 universality——只需要 binary > graduated，which holds whenever K*≤2 for the given generator-scorer pair。\"\n    tables:\n      - caption: \"Dose-response: MMLU by contamination level and filtering strategy\"\n        columns: [dose, no_filter, graduated_a09, binary_ours, Δ(binary-nofilter)]\n        rows:\n          - [\"10%\", 0.5962, 0.5981, 0.5987, \"+0.0025\"]\n          - [\"30%\", 0.5865, 0.5892, 0.5941, \"+0.0076\"]\n          - [\"50%\", 0.5791, 0.5834, 0.5878, \"+0.0087\"]\n    figures_description:\n      - \"Line plot: x=contamination dose, y=MMLU. Three lines (no-filter declining steeply, graduated declining moderately, binary declining least). Gap between binary and no-filter widens with dose.\"\n    analysis: \"Dose-response 是 C3 的 robustness check。在 worst tier 下结论不变：binary filtering 在所有 dose 下 ≥ graduated。更重要的是，这个实验不依赖 universality claim，所以 reframing 不影响它。但措辞需调整：从 'K*=2 universally predicts binary optimality' 到 'for matched generator-scorer conditions where K*=2, binary filtering is optimal; for mismatched conditions where K*=1, even binary detection may be unreliable'。\"\n\n  - name: \"Domain ablation (Wikipedia seeds)\"\n    plan_id: \"exp-023\"\n    description: \"Wikipedia seed data, Qwen2.5-1.5B (base) continuation mode, nucleus p=0.95 T=1.0, 5K docs, depth 0-5, scorer=Qwen2.5-1.5B\"\n    expected_results:\n      k_star: 2\n      pairwise_auc:\n        0v1: 0.9834\n        1v2: 0.6056\n        2v3: 0.5412\n        3v4: 0.5187\n        4v5: 0.5078\n      bootstrap_ci:\n        1v2: {auc: 0.6056, ci_lower: 0.5953, ci_upper: 0.6158, perm_p: 0.0001}\n        2v3: {auc: 0.5412, ci_lower: 0.5312, ci_upper: 0.5513, perm_p: 0.0001}\n      pairwise_jsd:\n        0v1: 0.1523\n        1v2: 0.0078\n        2v3: 0.0041\n        3v4: 0.0028\n        4v5: 0.0022\n      ordinal_mae: 1.23\n      ordinal_accuracy: 0.3512\n    result_rationale: \"Wikipedia vs C4 的对比在 worst tier 下是 marginal K*=2（CI lower=0.5953 < 0.60，判定边缘）。Wikipedia 文本比 C4 更 structured（longer sentences, more formal register, less noise），Qwen 对 Wikipedia-style 续写的质量更高（training data 中 Wikipedia 比例大），depth-1 文本与 human Wikipedia 的差距更小。但因为是 self-scoring（Qwen→Qwen），仍 K*=2——though barely。Worst tier 下 CI lower=0.5953 实际上使这个结果 ambiguous（θ=0.60 定义下 technically K*=1）。选择报告为 K*=2（point estimate > 0.60）但 acknowledge CI lower < θ。这是 worst tier 的 boundary case：domain 选择影响 signal strength，Wikipedia 比 C4 更难但不足以翻转结论（在自评条件下）。\"\n    tables:\n      - caption: \"Domain comparison: C4 vs Wikipedia (Qwen-1.5B base, self-scoring)\"\n        columns: [domain, auc_0v1, auc_1v2, ci_lower_1v2, k_star, note]\n        rows:\n          - [C4, 0.9971, 0.6112, 0.6015, 2, \"exp-017 reference\"]\n          - [Wikipedia, 0.9834, 0.6056, 0.5953, \"2 (marginal)\", \"CI lower < θ\"]\n    figures_description:\n      - \"Paired AUC decay curves for C4 (solid) and Wikipedia (dashed). Wikipedia consistently ~0.5-1pp lower at each depth pair. Both cross θ between 1v2 and 2v3, but Wikipedia's 1v2 CI band straddles θ=0.60.\"\n    analysis: \"Wikipedia 的 marginal 结果在 worst tier 中增加了 limitation disclosure 的负担：'K*=2 characterization is robust for C4 web text but approaches measurement limits for more structured domains like Wikipedia'。在 reframed narrative 中这反而是 good evidence for the framework：K* 取决于 (model, domain, scorer) tuple，Wikipedia 的 higher quality → smaller per-generation information loss → K* 趋向 1。DPI framework predicts this correctly。\"\n\n  - name: \"Naturalistic validation (Common Crawl)\"\n    plan_id: \"exp-014\"\n    description: \"Common Crawl 2025/2026 snapshot 样本做 depth 预测，与 AlignScore 和 vocabulary richness 指标做 correlation\"\n    expected_results:\n      n_samples: 10000\n      predicted_depth_distribution:\n        depth_0: 0.72\n        depth_1: 0.18\n        depth_2: 0.07\n        depth_3_plus: 0.03\n      correlation_with_alignscore:\n        spearman_rho: -0.31\n        p_value: 0.0001\n      correlation_with_vocab_richness:\n        ttr_spearman: -0.28\n        hapax_spearman: -0.25\n      key_caveat: \"no ground truth depth labels — correlational only\"\n    result_rationale: \"Naturalistic validation 在 worst tier 下仍有信息量但 claim 弱化。OBD classifier 对 Common Crawl 文本做 depth prediction：大部分为 depth-0 (human)，~18% 预测为 depth-1（consistent with 估计的 web synthetic content 比例），few depth-2+。与 AlignScore（factual consistency）的 negative correlation（ρ=-0.31）说明 predicted deeper text 确实质量更低，但 correlation 弱（<0.5）且无 ground truth。在 worst tier 下 cross-family K*=1 意味着 classifier 可能 misclassify cross-family 生成文本为 depth-0，underestimating 污染比例。论文中只能 claim 'OBD predictions correlate with independent quality proxies' 而不能 claim 'accurate depth estimation in the wild'。\"\n    tables: []\n    figures_description:\n      - \"Scatter plot: x=OBD predicted depth, y=AlignScore (jittered). Mild negative trend. Violin plots showing vocab richness distributions per predicted depth — depth-0 highest, depth-1 lower, depth-2+ lowest.\"\n    analysis: \"在 reframed narrative 中，naturalistic validation 的 role 变为 'demonstrating practical applicability of the characterization framework' 而非 'proving K*=2 in the wild'。Key limitation 必须 acknowledge：cross-family scorer dependence 意味着 OBD 可能 miss 来自不同 model family 的 synthetic text。这激励 future work on family-adaptive scoring。\"\n\n# Worst tier 总结统计\nsummary:\n  total_conditions_tested: 18  # 10 original + 2 Pythia decoding K*=2 + 2 Pythia decoding K*=1 + LLaMA + Mistral + length 128 + length 256/512\n  total_kstar_2: 12  # 10 original + 2 Pythia decoding (greedy/nuc)\n  total_kstar_ne_2: 5  # LLaMA K*=1, Mistral K*=1, Pythia T=0.7 K*=1, Pythia T=1.2 K*=1, 128-token K*=1\n  cross_scorer_kstar2_fraction: 0.625  # 10/16\n  narrative_status: \"Universal K*=2 → bounded K*∈{1,2,3} dependent on (model family, scorer family, text length)\"\n  headline_result: \"First systematic measurement of K*; bounded ≤3; predictable from model-scorer family match\"\n  c1_impact: \"降级为 characterization methodology contribution\"\n  c3_impact: \"不受影响（binary > graduated 在所有 K*≤2 条件下成立）\"\n  venue_risk: \"EMNLP main 仍可行（methodology + framework novelty），但从 oral candidate 降为 poster/findings 风险增大\"\n```","stop_reason":"end_turn","session_id":"5c70739c-9299-48de-8236-13269acff92e","total_cost_usd":0.5592505,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":33100,"cache_read_input_tokens":11841,"output_tokens":12731,"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":33100,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"","iterations":[{"input_tokens":2,"output_tokens":12731,"cache_read_input_tokens":11841,"cache_creation_input_tokens":33100,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":33100},"type":"message"}],"speed":"standard"},"modelUsage":{"claude-haiku-4-5-20251001":{"inputTokens":28060,"outputTokens":22,"cacheReadInputTokens":0,"cacheCreationInputTokens":0,"webSearchRequests":0,"costUSD":0.02817,"contextWindow":200000,"maxOutputTokens":32000},"claude-opus-4-6":{"inputTokens":2,"outputTokens":12731,"cacheReadInputTokens":11841,"cacheCreationInputTokens":33100,"webSearchRequests":0,"costUSD":0.5310805,"contextWindow":200000,"maxOutputTokens":64000}},"permission_denials":[],"terminal_reason":"completed","fast_mode_state":"off","uuid":"94a07b3c-2a20-4d1f-b1cb-77f253a3b647"}
